plasma-browser-integration (5.19.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Team upload.

  [ Scarlett Moore ]
  * New upstream release.
  * Update salsa-ci config for reprotest.
  * Add gbp.conf for salsa ci git-buildpackage.
    - Add configuration for git-overlay on salsa-ci.
    - Update .gitattributes for salsa-ci and gbp.
  * Update build dependencies as per cmake.
    - Removed libkf5windowsystem-dev no longer needed.
  * Raise ECM build dep version to 5.64 as it requires
    a module ( kde_clang_format ) introduced with that release.
  * Add rules-requires-root to control file as per lintian.
  * Bump Standards to 4.5.0; no changes required.
  * Refresh copyright with new copyright, fix formatting.
    - Fix KDEev clause copyright to correctly reflect the upstream copyright.
    - Review and update all copyright holders.
    - According to policy 12.5 Sources field should be a link to the actual
